#: scenario8:scenario8_7271CF53_2F9D_4C71_BB5A_EFD55E3FD8B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba14113af1000ee8e0606e619d6fd473101de7f61197b2cb89d87eb23fe6539f
#. default-sha256: 1f75fe120fb4cf7766c9bb34a8c909046138f3c9da75dce8581438afe376ed56
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7271CF53_2F9D_4C71_BB5A_EFD55E3FD8B8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After discussions I had no part in, it was decided that my uncle would be the next head. "
"⟪k:1⟫That they weren’t confident I had the spine to do the job properly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫僕みたいな甘い奴に後を継がせるのが不安だったんだろうね。⟪k:1⟫結局、⟪k:2⟫話し合いの末、⟪k:3⟫後"
"継者は叔父ということになった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_14AA6030_BFFC_4D54_8F5F_CD1BA4D4AA3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea64246a9b9103b32a5043ff183e7d60735d4bf0f53162107de061070e4cf77f
#. default-sha256: 1b89577e1b62739e2a78b9c04bea8a697d1c8b5931f1396262933ed68c1c1168
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_14AA6030_BFFC_4D54_8F5F_CD1BA4D4AA3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫すべてが知らないうちに決められて――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫正直、⟪k:3⟫戸惑ったよ。⟪k:4⟫どうして僕には何も言"
"わないのかって。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_826116EA_6045_40AC_A4A1_DE73A200E194
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5e9acbf9367a5b04a88ce7f91070c63e986bef10722ec536be5e1f5b69e47af
#. default-sha256: 031b65fcb78d6ac53309341727e4f091f72e4c3ccbe073e29bfc89dd24c825e9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_826116EA_6045_40AC_A4A1_DE73A200E194"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If it meant I could go on with my quiet life,⟪k:1⟫I didn’t care who they picked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫僕が今まで通り平和に暮らせるなら……、⟪k:1⟫別に、⟪k:2⟫なんだって良かったんだよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A7480C5_2579_4E5D_BD3A_355A5A2BB7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7a0153f91dc009641bdc6fc3b429ab1e0ed5d7f37091eb710020839dc8d883b
#. default-sha256: ac02e1e24f808aaeb6087cc0df7a52d5877e44a654ca5098bc4fb6d992f8a21b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A7480C5_2579_4E5D_BD3A_355A5A2BB7BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My uncle, though, seemed to have caught on to my apathy,⟪k:1⟫which he did not take kindly to,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫恐らく、⟪k:1⟫僕のそういう性格とか、⟪k:2⟫態度が……見抜かれていたんだろうね。⟪k:3⟫そして、⟪k:4⟫"
"叔父の逆鱗に触れたわけだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0F9B4C2F_8D4B_457A_9E21_31B09E682CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b61ddcff94a72831f59dfcfd52d89829380de1e388f4257562d0e3ed2863083d
#. default-sha256: a8bcd374d856a7feb418be720e90eeb5a4484bf766cd1ae5251848d5e06156b7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0F9B4C2F_8D4B_457A_9E21_31B09E682CB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So this is our new home, dearest Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ここがネリーとお兄さまの新居ってわけね！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C46DB12A_F1A6_4AEF_80D6_1C916DF0125C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf312bbe42e65950b41cb2fc178a7073a7d9892021352f2103ea1b2b75de9b4b
#. default-sha256: 9dd3cbdafeb86e46212886c675c55fb308e3233b9dcac477cdfaad01540a2c99
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C46DB12A_F1A6_4AEF_80D6_1C916DF0125C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BA103644_E5BA_4A61_A657_15137CCE2AB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c20f628cbfb13abba90d8e8346dc17f94d106c1612f31fef4e9348065c109bf
#. default-sha256: b2778700e0c1f2c0a69a2d7c4b422e7f2e38c369bc97ebe08ffa1b653a46aa33
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BA103644_E5BA_4A61_A657_15137CCE2AB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not going to go and say you want to return home in a couple months when you realize "
"life isn’t as luxurious here as it was back there, are you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本当に良かったの？　⟪k:1⟫だって、⟪k:2⟫僕と来るっていうことは、⟪k:3⟫もう……家に居た頃みたいな良"
"い生活は出来ないんだよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D53E37F5_E62E_43EB_85DE_F5F5852B0380
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 528ff16a38065b7fa412ba71cb32f299c13911f41fcce74536498ac3eb3b2f47
#. default-sha256: c85d09037bf60f5eb8bbd6f77b38d0f837b77f6e9a93f78bd4cf94c8822e8446
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D53E37F5_E62E_43EB_85DE_F5F5852B0380"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There’s only one thing in the whole wide world I really need."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ネリーが本当に欲しいものは、⟪k:2⟫世界でたったひとつだけだもの。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9C7B0D6_955F_47A6_A1B6_B3B638AA981D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d2fe8ffba42357a6f6efe3f2e4e7dc7194ef8012099ae024048f1435114c5da
#. default-sha256: 34cbfdedc5706975287d3c7c2c83b2d911fc598ecbade1ce766043017ee833c1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E9C7B0D6_955F_47A6_A1B6_B3B638AA981D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe. I’m as happy as I’ve ever been.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I don’t need all that fancy, expensive "
"stuff."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ふふっ、⟪k:2⟫ネリーは今ね、⟪k:3⟫幸せなくらいなの。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫贅沢な暮らしなんて必要ない"
"わ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D08E366E_EA6D_46C9_9B0F_8668427BDBE3
