msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wha— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That can’t be right...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I’m sure I’ve been smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫え、⟪k:3⟫そ、⟪k:4⟫そうかな……。⟪k:5⟫笑ってたと思うんだけど……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9a7881aa0a7d8634a2e5db6b74dda820bf09db869318a0138022b0884ad544
#. default-sha256: ca589cf56315e4ece96e49ce86552bff18c4274f32d242bd49595d82ebb7a1e0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m really glad you decided to come with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ありがとう、⟪k:1⟫ネリー。⟪k:2⟫君がいてくれて良かった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffdda194eb22a7518581786016d709c86347da35369463c328d5d96d36de4700
#. default-sha256: 71b2301b358149a34e32945fba1b791f4a5efd7fcb738913a578044427c5075b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Until that day, I had never known how good it felt to have someone who wanted me "
"in their life—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫誰かに存在を求められるということや――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫僕を見てくれるということが――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0e5998d605606d5744fb54cac779becd048ad03a406f331b424aba59e65d0ea
#. default-sha256: a75d6cf9b9fbcafbc0058e9243c6c6a30cd893414cc4dcdb4c1c6e78612765e9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫who saw me for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫こんなにも、⟪k:1⟫嬉しいものだなんて、⟪k:2⟫初めて知った。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00ce9ae7dc5feb95c9beb0e7db682b98712ffc0226f00b6e9109d243ac1ce0ca
#. default-sha256: 03124020f91c3afc798837bc07e75582cb53ee060a0c87a4338e91312af77021
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was hardly prince material—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t strong or handsome or regal enough for that—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫僕はとても王子なんて柄じゃなくて……、⟪k:1⟫もっとみすぼらしくてみっともない存在だったけど――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79f25a06f9b9830e282cda2b07ede3f6ae2378b8e846890f49e944195b24ba25
#. default-sha256: 473d649b32c308c22d88200b7cc35430af213ce766f6899d57cd605c0ee49314
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I’m staying home because I want to be with you as much as possible.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今はネリーの傍にいてあげたいから、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫外にはあまりいかないんだ――って。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cab85e69783fe3ffb2dab328622af9ca44002f37a1355338405b60ed7301051
#. default-sha256: 395c2e952f0e4dfd8faf293f9d92c1dfd32eb9b96af54ecb6d158e93cb089e05
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Welcome home, dearest Mell! What did you buy today?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あっ、⟪k:4⟫おかえりなさいお兄さま！　⟪k:5⟫今日は何を買ってきたの？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7f63f0b3bf52340a2652d8a0171e3121724251eba9816d32c3914027a7e4306
#. default-sha256: 66e726a4f3c0da69e20f46c96438476f8556efa69b67d4f9502fecc63fa58d09
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wow! I’ve never seen one so up close before!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are we going to keep it as a pet?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫わあっ、⟪k:2⟫ネリー、⟪k:3⟫こんな近くでにわとりさんを見るの、⟪k:4⟫初めて！　⟪k:5⟫この子、"
"⟪k:6⟫どうするの？　⟪k:7⟫ペットにするの？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B6DAF2C0_14E5_41D0_9248_6F5891F8439C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6151e1f154bda6988855a7d229a1c630a6aae5c2b33be79893809886763d15c
