msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But it’s all... ⟪k:2⟫covered in feathers and flapping about...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How are we "
"supposed to cook it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫でも……、⟪k:2⟫羽毛でふかふかだし、⟪k:3⟫元気に動いているし……、⟪k:4⟫どうやってこの子を料理"
"にしたらいいのかしら。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30426D9F_11EC_4A91_8E52_B06B67C70361
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c090f08263cac03e4ce6c3226db63ba675a17c84e1a8f9ef833a52758d9d896
#. default-sha256: c09575fba8139ad99ad931fa5eff62b7a52b5fa7bb04a373fc673e10d45cbf30
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30426D9F_11EC_4A91_8E52_B06B67C70361"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eeeeeew! No way! Absolutely not! Not in a million years!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いやーっ！　⟪k:2⟫むり！　⟪k:3⟫絶対にむりっ！⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫そんなこと、⟪k:6⟫ネリーできな"
"いっ！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CBA189C6_D4F7_4EBA_A64C_A8A869AB74C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8868fdd99efd7d325af88850501983d28e00c3658b8ad16ec265f7dcf2277bf
