msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あ、⟪k:1⟫ありがとうございます……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2812205_6202_4D04_9BE7_54FB26D38F3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
